    detail: { q: 'According to the text, what did farms with more nearby woodland have?', a: 'larger apple harvests', w: ['fewer wild bee nests', 'more honeybee hives', 'smaller apple blossoms'] },
    fn: { i: 1, a: 'It presents a finding that challenges the assumption in the first sentence.', w: ['It explains how honeybees decide which apple blossoms to visit first each spring.', 'It describes a method the farmers used to count their trees.', 'It offers a personal story about one farmer in the valley.'] },
    inf: { stem: 'Based on the survey, farmers in the valley who want larger apple harvests should most likely ______', a: 'protect the woodland near their orchards.', w: ['replace their apple trees with other crops.', 'remove the woodland to make room for hives.', 'stop all bees from visiting their blossoms.'] },
