    fn: { i: 0, a: 'It states an ability that the rest of the text explains.', w: ['It describes the size of a barn owl’s nest.', 'It compares barn owls with other kinds of owls.', 'It explains why mice are active only at night.'] },
    inf: { stem: 'Based on the text, if a barn owl’s ears were at the same height, the owl would most likely ______', a: 'have more trouble finding where a sound came from.', w: ['be able to hear sounds from much farther away.', 'stop hunting mice and start hunting insects.', 'see much better in complete darkness.'] },
