    inf: { stem: 'Based on Tanaka’s findings, a county that moves its elections to Saturday should expect ______', a: 'some groups to vote more and others slightly less.', w: ['every age group to vote much less than before.', 'no change at all in who turns out to vote.', 'only older residents to take part in elections.'] },
