    inf: { stem: 'Based on the experiment, a caterpillar from a migrating family raised in a garden would most likely ______', a: 'still grow longer wings as an adult.', w: ['grow the same short wings as local monarchs.', 'never be able to fly as an adult butterfly.', 'grow wings only after its first migration.'] },
